{"title":"Ogre Youth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 30 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (0.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>793</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>71</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>85</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>78</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>48</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>81</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>243</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>135</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>106</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>85</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>57</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=0\" title=\"Pick level 0\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1.5</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 2.1 · 150</td><td>793</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>71</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>85</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>78</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>48</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>81</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>243</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>135</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>106</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>85</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>57</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/e91fb7